{"kind":"report","text":"Email-free Start a room comparison completed. Room identity already uses an Ed25519 key, without email. Options: generate a browser key automatically and offer one recovery file after room creation; add a passkey-assisted account with new signing-key integration; require an operator-issued creation ticket with an automatically generated key; or use an existing eligible key as an advanced path. Creation tickets control admission and can combine with either key approach; existing-room invitations do not authorize new room claims. Recommend Room name -\u003e Start room -\u003e automatic key and bounded server admission -\u003e room ready -\u003e save recovery file. Email was a hosting-proposal choice, not a native identity requirement. Without any backup or another authorized identity, a lost sole key cannot be recovered from the room name. Bot checks and serving limits are separate from email and do not establish one-person identity. Current Page first-run and passkey/fresh-founding-offer integrations remain unimplemented; no source or prototype changed. Sources checked: current Page allowedClaim, signed-key model and W3C WebAuthn Level 3; Cloudflare Turnstile requires server token validation."}